 ## Background
-Primary Shading is implemented in the `destructible-voxel-engine` repository [S1, unofficial]. It is designed to handle shading for traced voxel materials, integrating various lighting components to achieve realistic appearances. The method reflects modern real-time rendering techniques adapted for voxel-based geometry, including image-based lighting and subsurface scattering.
